{"team_id":1,"pool":10,"valid":1,"players":[{"player_id":1,"firstname":"Adam","lastname":"Turcotte","num":19,"games":12},{"player_id":2,"firstname":"Andrew","lastname":"Carroll","num":3,"games":12},{"player_id":3,"firstname":"Ari","lastname":"Nitikman","num":23,"games":12},{"player_id":4,"firstname":"Dan","lastname":"LaFrance","num":86,"games":12},{"player_id":5,"firstname":"Jacky","lastname":"Hau","num":15,"games":12},{"player_id":6,"firstname":"JJ","lastname":"Edwards","num":11,"games":12},{"player_id":7,"firstname":"Jordan","lastname":"Vogel","num":2,"games":12},{"player_id":8,"firstname":"Keith","lastname":"McRae","num":41,"games":12},{"player_id":9,"firstname":"Luc","lastname":"Comire","num":5,"games":12},{"player_id":10,"firstname":"Michael","lastname":"Mackenzie","num":7,"games":12},{"player_id":11,"firstname":"Phil","lastname":"Turner","num":34,"games":12},{"player_id":12,"firstname":"Quinn","lastname":"Snider","num":98,"games":12},{"player_id":13,"firstname":"Rumi","lastname":"Tejpar","num":81,"games":12},{"player_id":14,"firstname":"Ryan","lastname":"Poloz","num":61,"games":12},{"player_id":15,"firstname":"Thomas","lastname":"Edmonds","num":8,"games":12},{"player_id":16,"firstname":"Toly","lastname":"Vasilyev","num":18,"games":12}],"spiritgiven":[{"game_id":35,"givento":"Spain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":"It was an absolute pleasure to play Spain! Both ways the physicality was consistent and safe, no contact beyond incidental. All calls were handled effectively and clearly in a timely manner. We had spirit circles before and after games and the energy was really amazing! Best of luck to them! "},{"game_id":5,"givento":"USA Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":38,"givento":"Germany Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":3,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":29,"givento":"Philippines Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"There were a few potentially dangerous bids throughout the game. We discussed between spirit captains and seemed to settle the problems. Additionally, one of my players commented that their mark repeatedly didn’t acknowledge contact calls, but this seems like a singular player comment"},{"game_id":39,"givento":"Ireland Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":22,"givento":"France Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":36,"givento":"Singapore Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":"An amazing game against an amazing group of people! Loved playing Singapore :) "},{"game_id":37,"givento":"Japan Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":"Always a pleasure to play Japan! "},{"game_id":14,"givento":"Great Britain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":152,"givento":"Philippines Open","cat1":1,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":8,"comments":"There was one bad bid into the back of one of my players legs without any chance of getting the disc. There was also a moment where the Philippines was arguing a contested goal and tried to reset the stall count incorrectly in their favour. \r\n\r\nWe had moments of poor spirit which we apologized for and I hope sorted out and nobody left the game feeling any ill will."},{"game_id":155,"givento":"USA Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":160,"givento":"Great Britain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":35,"givenby":"Spain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":5,"givenby":"USA Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":38,"givenby":"Germany Open","cat1":2,"cat2":3,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":29,"givenby":"Philippines Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":2,"total":8,"comments":null},{"game_id":39,"givenby":"Ireland Open","cat1":2,"cat2":3,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":22,"givenby":"France Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":36,"givenby":"Singapore Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":37,"givenby":"Japan Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"There was one foul call incident early on where we both probably felt frustrated, and we took away things that we could improve on. However we maintained a good dialogue, and at the end of the game we feel both teams were satisfied with the Spirit shown. "},{"game_id":14,"givenby":"Great Britain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":152,"givenby":"Philippines Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":null},{"game_id":155,"givenby":"USA Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":160,"givenby":"Great Britain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":4,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":14,"comments":null}],"spiritstats":{"games":12},"spirittotal":{"total":130}}